{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21987","headline":"续古诗十首 三 · 白居易","name":"续古诗十首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝采山上薇，暮采山上薇。\n岁晏薇亦尽，饥来何所爲。\n坐饮白石水，手把青松枝。\n击节独长謌，其声清且悲。\n枥马非不肥，所苦常絷维。\n豢豕非不饱，所忧竟爲牺。\n行行歌此曲，以慰常苦饥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21987.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21987","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}